Summary: Denial-AI fidelity: does a model restate a published FHA-denial statistic within its use contract? Inspect AI tasks (no tools / web / publisher MCP source / receipt-aware client) over a frozen 12-question battery with a model-free value scorer and a contract-graded fidelity scorer.
